      "content": "i get that, but i really dont have the time or money for a doctor right now. i've already bought some high strength ferrous sulfate supplements. if i just took like 300mg or 400mg a day for a couple of weeks, wouldn't that just fix the deficiency quickly? i've read people do way more than that for optimization. wouldn't that be okay for a short burst?",
